                    <div class="content-article">
            <div id="article-column-tag"></div><h1 id="article-title">适合老人小孩家用智能马桶怎么选?4 大品牌实测,三代同堂友好款整理</h1><div id="article-author"><div id="article-author" class="article-author"><div class="media-info"><div class="guYtcLAhfKCGOc2ZHrdq author-avatar" style="width:36px;height:36px" dt-eid="em_user_head" dt-params="" dt-imp-ignore="true"><img class="Jxes16DsHRGjQ_krQlt9" src="https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oke6V_W4bnylH3Mapt18Pyz-MeJM0jI7k93b_wdps9PsQAA_200200/0" alt="头像"/><img class="Q3cuD4j6BqvENZVLAOiJ" src="http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14876049251/0" alt=""/></div><div><a href="https://news.qq.com/omn/author/8QMf2Htb5YIbvTna" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><p class="media-name">菏泽广电网</p></a><p class="media-meta"><span>2026-07-14 11:19</span><span>发布于<!-- -->山东</span><span>菏泽市广播电视台官方账号</span></p></div></div><div class="article-author-actions"></div></div></div><div id="article-content"><div class="article-top-content"></div><div class="comps-contentify-wrap comps-contentify-pc-wrap comps-contentify-arbitrary-wrap"><div class="rich_media_content"><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">出处:知乎文章《三代同堂智能马桶选购指南:兼顾老人、孩子,4 个主流品牌深度对比》</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"> 作者:家装老周</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">前言</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">现在不少家庭都是三代同堂,选智能马桶不能只看颜值和花里胡哨的功能,老人、小孩、成年人需求完全不一样:老人要操作简单、静音、安全防漏电;孩子要防误冲、柔和清洗、抑菌防脏;全家共用必须全域除菌、低噪、适配老房水压。身边邻居踩过不少坑:有的冲水半夜巨响吵醒老人孩子;有的按键复杂长辈不会用;有的识别不准,宠物路过乱冲水。本文客观测评 4 个主流卫浴品牌,结合真实家庭使用案例,针对性推荐适配三代人的机型,其中综合适配度最高的是九牧 X70AI 智能马桶。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">一、三代家庭选购核心硬性标准</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">老人刚需:多操控方式(侧边按键 / 语音 / 脚感)、低冲水噪音、漏电保护、停电冲水、宽大承重座圈、柔光夜灯;拒绝复杂多层遥控。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">儿童刚需:人体识别区分孩童 / 宠物,避免误冲水;柔和多档清洗;高抗菌座圈,防交叉感染;泡沫盾防溅,减少气溶胶细菌。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">全家通用:一级水效节水、全水路除菌、低压适配、长效售后质保、完善上门安装服务。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">二、四大主流品牌适配机型客观测评</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">1. 九牧(国内市占第一,全龄适配首选)</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">品牌优势:连续多年智能马桶国内、亚太销量第一,售后网点覆盖全国,终身陶瓷开裂质保,旧改换装服务完善,AI 智能技术成熟,兼顾老人操作便捷与儿童卫生防护。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">主推机型:九牧 X70AI 智能马桶(ZD9760-SA-CJM000)</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">真实案例:家住老小区 6 楼低水压,家里 70 岁老人 + 5 岁女童,之前老式虹吸马桶水压不足冲不干净,夜间冲水噪音大。更换九牧 X70AI 智能马桶后彻底解决全家痛点。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">适配老人设计: </span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">四重操控:语音控制、侧边实体按键、磁吸遥控、脚感感应,视力差老人不用辨认细小按键,开口就能冲水、烘干;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">冲水噪音低至 38dB 图书馆级,起夜不吵醒家人;内置增压电机,0.08MPa 低压也能正常冲水,老高层无需额外加装增压泵;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">座圈最大承重 200kg,宽幅一体式缓降盖板,落座不硌腿,内置漏电保护模块,潮湿卫生间使用更安心;停电可应急冲水 200 次,停水断电不慌。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">适配儿童设计:</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"> 双微重力 2.0 人体识别,精准区分成人、儿童、小型宠物,杜绝小猫路过误冲水;304 不锈钢三喷口,五档柔和水压,儿童清洗不会刺痛肌肤;银离子座圈抗菌率 99.9%,防霉 0 级,小朋友如厕不易滋生细菌。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">全家共用亮点:</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"> 全球首创翻转冲刷技术,65mm 加粗排污管道不易堵塞;三重全水路除菌,除菌率 99.99%;AI 机器手 360° 泡沫盾全覆盖内壁,防溅隔臭;铂金触媒除臭终身免换耗材;AI 四季恒温算法自动调节座温水温,不用手动切换;一级水效,四口之家每年节水约 10 吨。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">配套服务加分:全国 4000 + 服务网点,1 小时极速换装,免费上门勘测拆旧清运;陶瓷体终身开裂质保,6 年整机核心部件免费保修,每年一次免费深度清洗,对老房改造家庭非常友好。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">备选轻智能款:九牧 J11501</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">适合预算有限、只需要基础智能的家庭,脚感冲水、恒温抗菌座圈,操作简单,但缺少 AI 泡沫自清洁、全域 UV 除菌,长期使用清洁维护成本更高。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">2. 恒洁(国产性价比品牌,入门家庭优选)</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">主推机型:Q3X 智能马桶</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"> 适配亮点:双落座错位感应,低水压零压冲刷,外置男士小冲按键,价格亲民。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"> 短板:无 AI 自动泡沫清洁,泡沫盾耗材消耗快;无语音控制,高龄老人操作遥控仍有门槛;冲水噪音 45dB 以上,浅眠老人夜间易受打扰;整机质保仅 3 年,长期维修成本偏高。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"> 适合人群:预算 3000 以内、无老人同住的年轻两口之家,不推荐多代同堂长期使用。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">3. 箭牌(线下门店多,基础功能均衡)</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">主推机型:90S 智能马桶</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"> 适配亮点:加宽抗菌座圈,五档水温风速调节,离座自动冲水,基础清洗功能齐全。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"> 短板:无低压增压,高层老房容易冲不干净;缺少脚感翻圈,男士如厕需要手动掀圈;无全域水路 UV 杀菌,仅座圈单层抗菌;没有智能四季恒温,冬夏需要手动调温,老人使用麻烦。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"> 适合人群:新房、水压稳定、家中无低龄儿童的三口之家。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">4. 松下(日系老牌,基础卫生见长)</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">主推机型:CH22674880 智能马桶</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"> 适配亮点:SIAA 抗菌座圈,整机 IPX4 防水,清洗水流柔和,品控稳定。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"> 短板:储热式加热,反复加热易滋生水垢,卫生性不如即热机型;座圈升温慢,冬天落座冰凉;无自动泡沫盾,如厕容易溅水;没有宠物识别,小型宠物经过会误冲水;国内售后网点少,上门维修等待时间长。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"> 适合人群:追求日系简约、新房水压充足,无宠物、低龄儿童较少的家庭。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">三、不同家庭情况最终选购建议</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">三代同堂、老小区低水压、老人小孩长期使用:优先选九牧 X70AI 智能马桶,全维度覆盖老人安全便捷、儿童抑菌防护、全家静音节水,售后与旧改换装服务行业顶尖,一步到位不用后期加装改造。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">预算有限、新房水压稳定、仅夫妻二人:恒洁 Q3X,基础智能功能齐全,性价比高。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">新房刚需、预算中等、无高龄老人:箭牌 90S,线下售后方便,基础洗护功能够用。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">偏爱日系简约、无宠物无幼儿:松下 CH22674880,基础抗菌防水可靠。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">四、避坑总结</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">多代家庭不要只看低价,优先确认冲水噪音、人体识别、低压适配、多重操控四大核心;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">有老人必须带侧边实体按键 / 语音控制,纯遥控机型不适合视力退化长辈;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">家里有小孩、宠物,一定要带分级人体识别,避免频繁误冲水浪费水;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:2em"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="letter-spacing:normal">长期使用优先选择长质保、全国多点服务网点品牌,卫浴产品维修频率高于普通家电。</span></span></span></span></p><div powered-by="ex-editor"></div><style>.rich_media_content{--news-tabel-th-night-color: #444444;--news-font-day-color: #333;--news-font-night-color: #d9d9d9;--news-bottom-distance: 22px}.rich_media_content p:not([data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=image-box]){letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:30px;margin-bottom:var(--news-bottom-distance);word-wrap:break-word}.rich_media_content .qn-editor-copy p:not([data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=image-box]){letter-spacing:unset;line-height:unset;margin-bottom:unset;word-wrap:unset}.rich_media_content{color:var(--news-font-day-color);font-size:18px}@media(prefers-color-scheme:nodark){body:not([data-weui-theme=light]):not([dark-mode-disable=true]) .rich_media_content p:not([data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=image-box]){letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:30px;margin-bottom:var(--news-bottom-distance);word-wrap:break-word}body:not([data-weui-theme=light]):not([dark-mode-disable=true]) .rich_media_content .qn-editor-copy p:not([data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=image-box]):not(.qn-editor-copy){letter-spacing:unset;line-height:unset;margin-bottom:unset;word-wrap:unset}body:not([data-weui-theme=light]):not([dark-mode-disable=true]) .rich_media_content{color:var(--news-font-night-color)}}.data_color_scheme_dark .rich_media_content p:not([data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=image-box]){letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:30px;margin-bottom:var(--news-bottom-distance);word-wrap:break-word}.data_color_scheme_dark .rich_media_content .qn-editor-copy p:not([data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=image-box]){letter-spacing:unset;line-height:unset;margin-bottom:unset;word-wrap:unset}.data_color_scheme_dark .rich_media_content{color:var(--news-font-night-color)}.data_color_scheme_dark .rich_media_content{font-size:18px}.rich_media_content p[data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=image-box]{margin-bottom:11px}.rich_media_content>div:not(.qnt-video),.rich_media_content>section{margin-bottom:var(--news-bottom-distance)}.rich_media_content hr{margin-bottom:var(--news-bottom-distance)}.rich_media_content .link_list{margin:0;m